+/* fonts-droid installs into /usr/share/fonts/droid/, and the rootfs overlay
+ * carries a "truetype -> ." symlink beside it, so this path resolves to that
+ * same file. Do not "correct" it to the install path: replacing that symlink
+ * with a real directory is what makes target-finalize's rsync fail. The "Full"
+ * face is deliberate -- the package ships both, and the plain one covers fewer
